  "text": "To whom it may concern. On Monday evening (March 9) I got this text: \"SunCoast Express Tolls: Our records show an unpaid toll of $4.95. To avoid a $50.00 late fee, pay today at https://suncoast-tolls.pay-now.top\". I drive the expressway every day so I didn't think twice and paid it on the link with my Cedar Ridge debit card. Yesterday morning I saw three charges I never made: two for $389.00 at ZEN*DIGITAL GOODS and one for $719.50 at PAYDROP*WALLET LOAD. I am disputing those three. The $4.95 toll payment I made myself, so I'm not disputing that one, and the $52.18 at the gas station was me too. All told these crooks got over $1,500 out of me. I've already forwarded the text to 7726 and filed a report with the FTC. If my money isn't back by Friday, I will file a complaint with the CFPB and with the state attorney general. I'm also going to lock my card in your app tonight so nothing else goes through."
